function 'pbi.NumberFormat' = ```
		() =>
		        VAR _value = SELECTEDMEASURE()
		        VAR _absValue = ABS( _value )
		        VAR _fstring = 
		            SWITCH( TRUE(),
		                _absValue>=1e9, "#,##0,,,.00B",
		                _absValue>=1e6, "#,##0,,,.0M",
		                _absValue>=1e3, "#,##0,.00K",
		                "#,##0"
		            )
		        RETURN 
		            _fstring
		```
	lineageTag: 970358e5-3cfa-43f6-9964-71b57e8d5025

